T1  - Concerns of Using Large Language Models in Health Care Research and Practice: Umbrella Review
AU  - Yarar, Feyza
AU  - Addis, Pauline
AU  - Fairweather, Megan
AU  - Craig, Dawn
AU  - O'Keefe, Hannah
JO  - Journal of Medical Internet Research
